# Deny everything, then re-include exactly the build inputs.
#
# This tree is consumed as the `libs` named build context by
# reforge/runner/Dockerfile.runtime (COPY --from=libs). Without an allowlist
# the context is 144 MB, 142 MB of which is node_modules.
#
# Keep this list in sync with the my-nodejs-libs entries in SOURCE_PATHS in
# reforge/runner/scripts/build-runtime-images.mjs. The revision hash is
# computed from SOURCE_PATHS while the image is built from this context; if
# they diverge, the tag describes a tree the image does not contain.
*

!package.json
!yarn.lock
!tsconfig.json
# The libs package compiles through its own build config, not the base one.
!tsconfig.build.json
!src
